commit 3586d2524f02c0e7af7526fe7e2df61ed8408172

C03: the reviewed turn accepts the privacy-sensitive capture operations (SCREEN1399)

«sacá un screenshot» (H0093) resolves to capture.screenshot, whose risk class (PrivacySensitive → Sensitive) requires a confirmation; an ordinary turn ends on the question and the reviewed turn rejected the pending operation as review_pending_not_supported because ProductConductorHost only admitted navigation, app.close, input.visible.click, system.settings.set and the clipboard operations.

ProductConductorHost: capture.screenshot and capture.active.window join the reviewed operations; the root reviewer approves only an argument-less capture (no path, no target). The capture stays in the profile's private capture directory and the final carries only its identity, dimensions and hash.

App recompiled (BUILD1399). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


